{
  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">KC桌面——外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">高盛：UMTLEO卫星业务与近期数据观察</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">UMT在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>第<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>交出了一份看似矛盾的成绩单：收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">76%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9.02亿</span>新台币，但环比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12%</span>，且低于GS和彭博一致预期。这份GS研报的核心判断是，短期业绩偏差源于主要客户的产品型号过渡，而非需求节奏变化。随着过渡影响在第<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>减弱，收入将恢复环比增长，毛利率也将从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">55.6%</span>回升。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">UMT主营矩形波导器件，用于微波和毫米波信号的传输。不同形状和组合的波导可以构成滤波器、耦合器、天线等射频无源组件。公司服务的客户是全球领先的低轨卫星运营商，其波导产品主要部署在卫星载荷和地面网关站。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWlVJq5rRjEhvhzskgP57xCZIMlPVrj2okZQ2uC1h3jlwTjjQhFYlgZtHDpyvAb8p2KlnoO6UsAfib7aexoiaiaGMLq1Tp8IrMauE/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1.业务与季度数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">2Q26收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9.02亿</span>新台币，较GS预期低<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7%</span>，较彭博一致预期低<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12%</span>。公司给出的解释是主要客户正在进行产品型号过渡，这一过程影响了出货节奏。毛利率从1Q26的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">58.0%</span>降至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">55.6%</span>，同样<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">低于预期</span>。营业费用率升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">28.8%</span>，高于GS预期的26.7%，研报将其归因于收入规模尚未完全摊薄固定费用。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的是，营业利润同比仍增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">158%</span>，说明业务基本面并未出现变化。净利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3.08亿</span>新台币，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">333%</span>，但其中可能包含一次性收益，研报未展开说明。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">KC评论</span>：</strong> 型号过渡是硬件供应链中常见的短期扰动，通常持续一到两个季度。关键观察点是3Q26收入能否如预期恢复环比增长，以及毛利率是否回到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">58%</span>以上。如果过渡结束后毛利率持续<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">低于预期</span>，则需要重新审视产品组合的定价能力。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUDwU1ZjmI1ZqghytnibN8XHfMyMibqiapjs8cjm0QGtK1LPEO0vAItrwBXtaA5aPAdYw3AQwWeJ15oqXBOU89IWBhXXA9Qa6dllw/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">月度与季度数据变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">GS预测UMT 7月收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.77亿</span>新台币，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">119%</span>、环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8%</span>；9月收入将跳升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.2亿</span>新台币，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">68%</span>。整个3Q26收入预期为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11.08亿</span>新台币，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">23%</span>，同比增长129%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">毛利率预期从2Q26的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">55.6%</span><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">回升</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">59.8%</span>，主要驱动力是低轨卫星业务收入占比持续提升，以及型号过渡影响消退。研报认为，随着收入规模扩大，营业费用率也将从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">28.8%</span>降至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">27.2%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这些预测建立在两个前提之上：客户型号过渡在3Q26基本完成，以及低轨卫星发射按计划推进。研报在观察提示中明确列出了“低轨卫星部署慢于预期”这一关键变量。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWvk4Q1Hgy73VibtcYm6j0pibNAEXcrDhYrDOlar43Fee84NIngCibDKulzliagKUlicFOgAwqibmYMJnGAIOVWoxgg7dic6gr4iaETVxc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3.卫星业务与近期数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">GS对UMT的长期增长叙事建立在产品结构升级上。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2024年</span>卫星业务收入占比为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">43%</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025年</span>升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">59%</span>，预计<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">80%</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>进一步升至93%。与之对应，传统电信运营商射频产品收入占比将从2023年的85%降至个位数。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">收入结构变化直接推动毛利率上行。研报预测毛利率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025年</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">51.1%</span>升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">60.9%</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">69.3%</span>。这一判断的依据是：每颗低轨卫星采用的频段增加，波导用量随之提升；同时，波导的应用场景从低轨卫星扩展到AI数据中心的高速互联。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">KC评论</span>： 卫星业务占比从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">59%</span>到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">93%</span>的跃升，意味着UMT正在完成从“电信组件供应商”到“卫星通信核心器件商”的定位转换。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWoqaZCZDgibl5AicMmHFlUYJgbaLnwj6PYfu2ZhpyB5h3uDxwBOwTgYq5cmv1qvrSPGOqqjpVDXAwBLRncTjCbb1advIpydewmc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC Desk\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 19-GS-UMT -3491.TWO-- LEO satellite business in expansion- 3Q26 to see GM improvement- 报告观点-260728</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见ΚСⅾеѕk․сοｍ</p>",
